'''Necromancer [[Tyrian armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign and is also available in the Factions campaign and Eye of the North expansion.

'''Note:''' Necromancer Tyrian armor art does not have headgear, but the [[Necromancer Ragged Scar Pattern]] is available from the same armorer in Factions and Eye of the North. Pictures and crafting details are available on that page.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Tyrian armor.

